# User-facing error messages (blueprint 11.4). One entry per code in errors/error-codes.toml.

error-APP-201 = The data directory cannot be created or opened.
error-APP-202 = The private file for starting the browser could not be created.
error-APP-301 = Another CodeSkimr instance is using this workspace and connecting to it failed.
error-APP-901 = An unexpected internal error occurred.
error-APP-601 = The browser could not be started.
error-CFG-101 = A configuration value is out of range or has the wrong type.
error-CFG-102 = A configuration file is not valid TOML.
error-CFG-103 = A configuration file or flag sets a setting that does not exist.
error-PRJ-101 = The source is neither an existing folder nor a valid Git URL.
error-PRJ-201 = The project is not registered. Scan its folder first with `codeskimr scan`.
error-PRJ-301 = A project with the same source is already registered.
error-PRJ-302 = A scan for this project is already running.
error-PRJ-303 = The scan was cancelled. No snapshot was written.
error-SRC-201 = The source folder does not exist or is not readable.
error-SRC-202 = The requested branch does not exist in the remote repository.
error-SRC-401 = The remote repository requires authentication and no usable credential is available.
error-SRC-501 = The source is larger than the configured limit.
error-SRC-601 = Fetching from the Git remote failed. Please try again later.
error-SRC-602 = The file watcher could not be started or stopped unexpectedly.
error-PRS-101 = A source file is not valid UTF-8 or UTF-16 and was skipped.
error-PRS-201 = No language pack is installed for this file type.
error-PRS-301 = The TOML or query files of a language pack are invalid.
error-PRS-501 = Parsing a file exceeded the configured time limit.
error-RES-101 = A SCIP index cannot be read, is corrupt or names a path outside the project. The references of the first level stay.
error-RES-201 = The indexer of this language or its toolchain is not installed or is older than the required version. The references of the first level stay.
error-RES-301 = A reference matches several symbols and was stored as probable.
error-RES-302 = Too few places of the SCIP index could be matched to symbols of the project. The references of the first level stay.
error-RES-501 = The SCIP index is larger than the configured limit and was not read. The references of the first level stay.
error-RES-502 = The indexer ran longer than the configured time limit and was stopped together with all its child processes. The references of the first level stay.
error-RES-503 = The indexer wrote more output than allowed and was stopped. The references of the first level stay.
error-RES-504 = The indexer used more memory than allowed and was stopped. The references of the first level stay.
error-RES-601 = The indexer could not be started or ended with an error. The references of the first level stay.
error-IDX-301 = A read model is out of date and is being rebuilt.
error-STO-301 = Applying a database migration failed.
error-STO-302 = A concurrent write conflicted. The operation can be retried.
error-STO-501 = Not enough disk space to save the snapshot.
error-STO-601 = The database reported an error.
error-STO-901 = Stored data is invalid. The database may be damaged.
error-SEC-201 = The referenced credential does not exist in the keystore.
error-SEC-202 = The keystore entry of the credential cannot be read. Delete it and create the credential again.
error-SEC-301 = Level 2 is not enabled and confirmed for this project, so no indexer is started.
error-SEC-401 = The platform rejected the credential.
error-SEC-402 = The operating system keystore denied access.
error-SEC-403 = Only the local owner may confirm or start indexers.
error-SEC-601 = The operating system keystore is not available.
error-SEC-901 = Locking secret memory against swapping failed.
error-NET-501 = The request to the external platform timed out.
error-NET-502 = The external platform rejected the request because of too many requests.
error-NET-601 = The OAuth sign-in did not complete.
error-AUTH-401 = You do not have the permission this action needs.
error-API-101 = The request is invalid.
error-API-102 = The server may only listen on the loopback address of this computer.
error-API-201 = This command or route does not exist.
error-API-301 = The server could not start on its port. It may already be in use.
error-API-401 = This change requires a valid installation token.
error-API-402 = The request does not come from this computer's own address.
error-API-403 = The launch code is wrong, already used or expired.
error-API-501 = The request is too large.
error-API-502 = The server is busy. Try again in a moment.
error-API-503 = The request took too long and was stopped.
error-API-601 = The local server is not running or cannot be reached. Start it with "codeskimr serve".
error-MCP-101 = The MCP tool arguments are invalid.
error-MCP-201 = The given path is not inside a registered project.
error-MCP-202 = No symbol with this id or qualified name exists.
error-MCP-203 = The project has not been scanned yet.
error-MCP-501 = The result was truncated to the configured limit.
error-CLI-101 = The command-line arguments are invalid.
error-CLI-102 = Watch mode needs a local folder; a Git URL cannot be watched.
error-CLI-103 = No secret could be read from the terminal or standard input, or it was empty.
error-I18N-201 = A text is missing for the selected language. English is shown instead.
error-EXP-201 = The built export page is missing or unusable. Build the UI with "npm run build" in web/.
error-EXP-601 = The export file could not be written.
error-UI-201 = The interface cannot reach the local server.
error-UI-901 = An unexpected error occurred in the interface.
error-CHK-101 = A literal outside the allowed exceptions was found.
error-CHK-102 = A code block duplicates existing code.
error-CHK-103 = A dependency points against the allowed direction.
error-CHK-104 = A function is longer than allowed.
error-CHK-105 = A function is more complex than allowed.
